<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH PTT CALLS OFF TALKS WITH PHILIPS.</title>
<headline>DUTCH PTT CALLS OFF TALKS WITH PHILIPS.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch post and telecoms group PTT Nederland NV said on Monday it had called off talks with Philips Communications on the combination of their cable TV interests.</p>
<p>&quot;We started talks about a year and a half ago aiming at enlarging our market share in the cable market,&quot; a Dutch PTT spokeswoman said. &quot;We could not come to a conclusion.&quot;</p>
</text>
